{"suttaId":"tha-ap131","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[5967,5985],"vripara":"91"},"segments":{"tha-ap131:0.3":"Gaṇṭhipupphiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap131:1.1":"“Suvaṇṇavaṇṇo sambuddho, vipassī dakkhiṇāraho;","tha-ap131:1.3":"Purakkhato sāvakehi, ārāmā abhinikkhami.","tha-ap131:2.1":"“Disvānahaṃ buddhaseṭṭhaṃ, sabbaññuṃ tamanāsakaṃ;","tha-ap131:2.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, gaṇṭhipupphaṃ [gatamaggaṃ (syā. ka.)] apūjayiṃ.","tha-ap131:3.1":"“Tena cittappasādena, dvipadindassa tādino;","tha-ap131:3.3":"Haṭṭho haṭṭhena cittena, puna vandiṃ tathāgataṃ.","tha-ap131:4.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhiropayiṃ;","tha-ap131:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap131:5.1":"“Ekatālīsito kappe, caraṇo nāma khattiyo;","tha-ap131:5.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap131:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap131:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā gaṇṭhipupphiyo [gandhapupphiyo (syā. ka.)] thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap131:8.1":"Gaṇṭhipupphiyattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2929,"to":2929,"paras":[{"para":2929,"vripara":"91","refs":["tha-ap131:1"],"lines":["So ekadivasaṃ pubbe katapuññaṃ saritvā somanassajāto “iminā kusalenāhaṃ nibbānaṃ patto”ti pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>suvaṇṇavaṇṇo sambuddho</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ sabbaṃ heṭṭhā vuttanayattā uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap131:1"],["tha-ap131:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap131:1.1","suvaṇṇavaṇṇo sambuddho",0,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
